    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.quick-decision",
      "id": "quick-decision",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "先问自己：是否愿意在户外、噪声与粉尘环境中，反复观察纹理、标线、分石并接受严格现场控制？"
            ]
          },
          "id": "rock-splitters-quarry.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "不要只看“体力活”；真正需要观察的是准确标线、工具状态确认、人员隔离和不确定时升级。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "rock-splitters-quarry.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "安全练习只审三张虚构任务卡的七字段：纹理判断、尺寸标线、方法工具、人员隔离、粉尘控制、爆破/授权边界、升级安排（触发条件+对象）。不进入现场、不操作设备或爆炸物。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "rock-splitters-quarry.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "A：纹理清楚；尺寸线齐；楔子+锤；隔离区已确认；粉尘控制未知；不含爆破；“粉尘控制不明即交采石场主管复核”，缺1。B：纹理未知；尺寸线齐；风镐；人员隔离未知；水+局排；不含爆破；“纹理或隔离不明即交班组长”，缺2。C：纹理清楚；尺寸线齐；楔子+锤；隔离区确认；水+局排；不含爆破；“任一条件变化即交班组长复核”，缺0。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "rock-splitters-quarry.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
