          "data": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "answer": "47-5051.00的核心是识别岩石纹理、标记尺寸或轮廓，并用风镐、楔子和锤等工具从采石场岩体分离粗尺寸石块。",
                "id": "rock-splitters-quarry.faq.1",
                "question_key": "career.faq.rock-splitters-quarry.daily-work",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-details"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "采石工从采石场岩体分离粗石块；制造业石材切割雕刻工按图样切割雕刻石材；石匠把石材安装成墙、桥台、路缘等结构。",
                "id": "rock-splitters-quarry.faq.2",
                "question_key": "career.faq.rock-splitters-quarry.role-comparison",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-details",
                  "onet-stonecutters",
                  "onet-stonemasons"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "O*NET显示该职业重视准确性、材料与设备检查、现场体力活动和机器过程控制。",
                "id": "rock-splitters-quarry.faq.3",
                "question_key": "career.faq.rock-splitters-quarry.fit",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-details"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "O*NET任务显示核心工作包含现场纹理判断、标线和使用工具进行物理分石。",
                "id": "rock-splitters-quarry.faq.4",
                "question_key": "career.faq.rock-splitters-quarry.ai-impact",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-details"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "数字表单只做草稿辅助；现场纹理、人员隔离、工具状态、爆破资格和停复工由人按雇主程序判断。",
                "id": "rock-splitters-quarry.faq.5",
                "question_key": "career.faq.rock-splitters-quarry.human-control",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "国家统计局2025工资资料按行业和人员大类聚合，不能作为采石工在中国的精确职业工资。",
                "id": "rock-splitters-quarry.faq.6",
                "question_key": "career.faq.rock-splitters-quarry.china-pay",
                "source_refs": [
                  "nbs-wages"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "美国2025年工资分位为年薪37,340/42,670/48,740/60,030/67,710美元，对应10/25/50/75/90分位。",
                "id": "rock-splitters-quarry.faq.7",
                "question_key": "career.faq.rock-splitters-quarry.us-pay",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-wages"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "O*NET将该职业列为Job Zone 1-2：通常高中学历或GED，相关经验从很少到数月或一年，岗位培训从数天到一年。",
                "id": "rock-splitters-quarry.faq.8",
                "question_key": "career.faq.rock-splitters-quarry.education-path",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-details"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "岩石切割、钻孔、破碎和运输可能产生可吸入结晶硅尘；NIOSH建议优先使用水、局部排风、隔离等工程控制，避免干扫或压缩空气清扫。",
                "id": "rock-splitters-quarry.faq.9",
                "question_key": "career.faq.rock-splitters-quarry.risk-boundary",
                "source_refs": [
                  "niosh-mining-dust",
                  "niosh-silica"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "美国2024年就业约3,200人，2024—2034预计增长3%—4%、期间空缺400；采矿采石油气占78%，制造业占15%。",
                "id": "rock-splitters-quarry.faq.10",
                "question_key": "career.faq.rock-splitters-quarry.outlook-transition",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-stats"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "小规模美国统计不应被外推为具体地区招聘承诺或中国市场需求。",
                "id": "rock-splitters-quarry.faq.11",
                "question_key": "career.faq.rock-splitters-quarry.career-worth",
                "source_refs": [
